  "releaseNotes": "• Removed the Octopus.Nuke.Components package. Its build components now live in this repository's own build\n• Removed the net8.0 and net9.0 targets. NUKE now targets net10.0, plus netstandard2.0 or net472 where it did before\n• Changed nuke :setup and nuke :update to set the build project's target framework to net10.0\n• Changed IHazGitVersion to run GitVersion's net10.0 build, which needs GitVersion.Tool 6.6.0 or later\n\nFull changelog at https://github.com/OctopusDeploy/nuke/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
